Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Pepsi put a price tag
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}on a fighter {\c&H006DDCFF&}jet{\r}.
